  "html": "<p style=\"text-align:center;\" align=\"center\">﻿<a href=\"https://whiteedental.co.kr/bbs/view_image.php?fn=%2Fdata%2Feditor%2F2608%2Fae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786582613_3888.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"view_image\"><img src=\"https://whiteedental.co.kr/data/editor/2608/thumb-ae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786582613_3888_600x336.jpg\" alt=\"ae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786582613_3888.jpg\"/></a><br style=\"clear:both;\" /><span></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">안녕하세요. </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><b>마산 화이트e치과</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">입니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">치과 치료를 받다 보면 충치나 치아 파절 등으로 인해</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(170,31,145);font-size:11pt;\"><b>치아를 씌워야 하는 상황</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">을 마주하기도 합니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">이때 많은 분이 어떤 치료를 받아야 할 지 고민에 빠지게 되는데요.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">과거에는 금이나 메탈 재료가 주로 사용되었지만,</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">최근에는 </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><u><b>자연치아와 유사한 심미성을 원하는 분</b></u></span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">들이 늘어나면서</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">세라믹 계열의 보철물이 큰 주목을 받고 있습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">그중에서도 </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 se-highlight __se-node\" style=\"background-color:rgb(253,213,245);font-size:11pt;\"><b>가장 대표적인 재료가 바로 지르코니아와 올세라믹</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">입니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">두 재료는 겉보기에 비슷해 보이지만 강도와 투명도 등에서 </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">뚜렷한 특징과 차이를 지니고 있는데요.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> 나에게 알맞은 선택을 돕기 위해 </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">두 보철물의 차이점과 특징을 비교해 보겠습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><a href=\"https://whiteedental.co.kr/bbs/view_image.php?fn=%2Fdata%2Feditor%2F2608%2Fae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786582973_7783.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"view_image\"><img src=\"https://whiteedental.co.kr/data/editor/2608/thumb-ae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786582973_7783_600x451.jpg\" alt=\"ae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786582973_7783.jpg\"/></a><br style=\"clear:both;\" /> </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:left;line-height:2.1;margin-left:400px;\" align=\"left\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;text-align:center;\"> 지르코니아는 '인공 다이아몬드'라고 불릴 만큼</span></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">현존하는 세라믹 보철물 중 </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(170,31,145);font-size:11pt;\">매우 뛰어난 강도를 자랑하는 재료</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">입니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">기존 세라믹의 단점이었던 깨짐 현상을 획득적으로 보완하여,</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">금속이 들어가지 않았음에도 </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><u>강한 힘</u></span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">을 견뎌낼 수 있습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">이러한 단단함 덕분에 음식을 먹을 때 강한 압력을 받는 어금니 부위나,</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(170,31,145);font-size:11pt;\">여러 개의 치아를 이어 붙여야 하는 브릿지 치료</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">에서 주로 선택됩니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">또한 부식 우려가 없고 인체 친화성이 높아</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">잇몸 주변의 변색이나 </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><u>알레르기 반응을 일으킬 확률이 낮다는 </u></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><u>장점</u></span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">도 가지고 있습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">✅ </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 se-highlight __se-node\" style=\"background-color:rgb(253,213,245);font-size:11pt;\">강력한 강도</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">:</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> 어금니처럼 강한 저작력이 필요한 부위에 적합</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">✅ </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 se-highlight __se-node\" style=\"background-color:rgb(253,213,245);font-size:11pt;\">우수한 인체 친화성</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">:</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> 금속 성분이 없어 잇몸 변색 우려가 적음</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">❗ 다만, 올세라믹에 비해 투명도가 다소 낮아</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">아주 미세한 심미성이 요구되는 앞니에는 제한적일 수 있습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://whiteedental.co.kr/bbs/view_image.php?fn=%2Fdata%2Feditor%2F2608%2Fae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786583153_051.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"view_image\"><img src=\"https://whiteedental.co.kr/data/editor/2608/thumb-ae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786583153_051_600x399.jpg\" alt=\"ae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786583153_051.jpg\"/></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\" align=\"center\"><span></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">세라믹은 보철물의 내부와 외부 전체를</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(170,31,145);font-size:11pt;\">세라믹(도자기) 성분으로만 제작하는 형태</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">를 말합니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">이 재료의 가장 큰 장점은 바로 </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><u>자연치아와 구별하기 힘들 정도</u></span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">로</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">유사한 투명도와 색조 재현력에 있는데요.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">빛이 통과하는 투과성이 매우 좋아 거울을 보거나</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">밝은 조명 아래에 있어도 </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 se-highlight __se-node\" style=\"background-color:rgb(253,213,245);font-size:11pt;\">인공적인 느낌 없이 자연스럽게</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> 어우러집니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">이 때문에<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,239,0);\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,239,0);\">심미적인 부분</span>이 무엇보다 중요한 앞니 </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">치료에 널리 활용되고 있습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">잇몸 라인에 블랙라인(금속 비침)이 생기지 않아 </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">깔끔한 미소를 유지하는 데 도움이 될 수 있습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">✅ 대화를 하거나 웃을 때 바로 보이는 </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(170,31,145);font-size:11pt;\">앞니 부위</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">의 치료인지 확인하기</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">✅ 자연치아 특유의 투명함과 </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(170,31,145);font-size:11pt;\">미세한 색상 조화</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">를 원하는지 따져보기</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">✅ 이갈이나 이악물기 같은 </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(170,31,145);font-size:11pt;\">강한 치아 압박 습관</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">이 있는지 점검하기</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">✅ 지르코니아에 비해 상대적으로 충격에 약해 </span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(170,31,145);font-size:11pt;\">파절 위험</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">이 있음을 인지하기</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"><a href=\"https://whiteedental.co.kr/bbs/view_image.php?fn=%2Fdata%2Feditor%2F2608%2Fae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786583176_5031.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"view_image\"><img src=\"https://whiteedental.co.kr/data/editor/2608/thumb-ae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786583176_5031_600x339.jpg\" alt=\"ae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786583176_5031.jpg\"/></a></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">﻿<span></span></span></p><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default se-is-focused\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">지르코니아와 올세라믹은 각각의 장단점이 명확하기 때문에,</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">어떤 재료가 무조건 우수하다고 말하기보다는</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><u>시술할 치아의 위치와 개인의 구강 습관에 맞추어</u></span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> 선택하는 것이 바람직합니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 se-highlight __se-node\" style=\"background-color:rgb(253,213,245);font-size:11pt;\">개인의 먹는 힘의 세기, 잇몸의 형태, 그리고 선호하는 심미적 기준</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">에 따라</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">결과의 만족도에는 차이가 있을 수 있는데요.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">따라서 보철 치료를 진행하기 전,</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(170,31,145);font-size:11pt;\"> 나에게 적합한 재료의 장단점</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">을</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">충분히 이해한 후 결정을 내리는 것이 오랫동안 편안하게 치아를 사용하는 건강한 방법입니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><br /></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">✔ <span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,239,0);\"><b>지르코니아</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">﻿</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-table se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-table se-l-default se-section-align-center se-is-block-selected se-is-selected\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"se-table-container\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">﻿<b>주요 장점 : 매우 단단한 강도, 우수한 내구성</b></span><b><br /></b></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><b>주요 단점 : 울세라믹 대비 불투명한 느낌</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><b>권장 적용 부위 : 어금니, 저작력이 강한 부위, 브릿지</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;\">✔ </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><b>﻿<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,239,0);\">울세라믹</span></b></span><br /></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><b>주요 장점 : 뛰어난 투명도, 자연스러운 심미성</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;\"><b>주요 단점 : 지르코니아 대비 충격에 의한 파절 우려</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;\"><b>권장 적용 부위 : 앞니, 송곳니 등 심미성이 강조되는 부위</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"> </p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default se-is-focused\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">가지고 있는 장점과 성질이 서로 다른 만큼,</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">나의 구강 환경에 잘 맞는 재료를 선택하는 것이</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">오랫동안 튼튼한 치아를 유지하는 비결입니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height:2.1;\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">꼼꼼하게 비교해 보시고 신중한 선택을 통해,</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(170,31,145);font-size:11pt;\">건강하고 환한 미소</span><span class=\"se-ff-system se-fs15 __se-node\" style=\"font-size:11pt;\">를 오랫동안 </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">편안하게 지켜나가시기를 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><br /></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2.1;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><a href=\"https://whiteedental.co.kr/bbs/view_image.php?fn=%2Fdata%2Feditor%2F2608%2Fae0de1e9e4dbc333c53dff707a249389_1786583669_9651.jpg\" target=\"